    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "The zero-momentum piece ∂yδϕ0 obeys the following diffusion equation,"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 15,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 83.338, 200.152, 511.941, 270.663 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 10.909,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "∂t − ν∂y2 ∂yδϕ0 = iα∂y ϕ∂yϕ − ϕ∂yϕ , (A.11) with viscosity ν serving as the diffusivity, and a current source term coming from the O(ϵ) perturbations. P(2), δϕ±α(t,y) are determined by other differential equations but we will not need them here."
